    "text": "\u00d0\u00e6s sind \u00fea engliscan landg\u00e6mere to Tantun\u00e6.\nTo Risctune; Erest on Blacanford, \u00f0anon andlang broces on Tan: \u00f0anon andlang Tan on \u00fea ealdan earace\nUpp andlang Beaddingcbroces on Beaddingcbricge: & \u00f0anon upp andlang Halgan Wylles; & \u00f0anon on\n\u00d0\u00e6t land w\u00e6s gebocod \u00f0reora manna deg \u00e6t Nigon Hidum Wulfhere Ciddingce on \u00fea gerat se \u00fee landes\nAnd \u00fea lant gesealde Esne bisceop his m\u00e6ge Deoreage & his magan Dene\u00f0ry\u00fee, \u00e6t Stoce & \u00e6t\n& \u00fe\u00e6t land \u00e6t Hegstealdcumbe Esne bisceop lende his m\u00e6ge Wynsie on \u00fea gerad \u00fee ealle \u00fea gerihta\n\u00d0is is \u00fe\u00e6t land to Cincgtune gemere.\nErest of Motleage, swa up on Hummapa\u00f0, \u00feonne adun on hearpa\u00f0: \u00f0onne on Finstowe, adun on\n\u00d0onne up on Bradanmed su\u00f0werde, \u00feonne on Noccanmere su\u00f0ewer\u00f0e: \u00feonne up on landsceare on\nTo Tantun\u00e6: \u00e6r\u00e6st \u00feer Beaddincbroc scyt innan Tan, \u00feanon to \u00feam ealdan \u00e6sce, swa \u00f0wyres ofer dune\n\u00deanon to \u00feere dene \u00fee man het Orcerdcumb.\n\u00d0anon gerihta ofer dune to \u00feam \u00f0yfele, \u00fee man het Bradan\u00f0orn: \u00feanon to \u00feam ambran wege.\n\u00deanon to Widecumbes heafde.\n\u00d0anon andlang ri\u00f0e to Eartancumbesforda.\n\u00deanon to \u00feere widan dic, & swa hit strec\u00f0 westwer\u00f0 on nor\u00f0healf \u00f0es holtes \u00fee man Duddincgbearu\n\u00deanon of \u00feere widan dic to Oterigcforda.\n\u00deanon up agen stream o\u00f0 hit cum\u00f0 to \u00f0es wulles heafde: \u00feanon on nor\u00f0healf, o\u00f0 hit cum\u00f0 to\n\u00deanon to Waldaneswege; swa to Oxenafelda.\n\u00d0anon to Snellescumbes heafde: swa for\u00f0 on gerihta to Greganstane & on westhealfe Manhylle, \u00feanon\nSwa ny\u00f0er andlang streames on \u00f0one readan ford.\n& swa west \u00feurh \u00feone holt o\u00f0 hit cym\u00f0 to Scytere: andlang Scyteres, on \u00feone ealdan for\u00f0.\n\u00deanon on westhealf on \u00feone deo\u00fean ford: \u00f0anon to Heardangeate.\n\u00deanon on su\u00f0healfe on Bennascumbes ri\u00f0e: swa ny\u00f0er on \u00f0ere ri\u00f0e for\u00f0ryne of \u00f0ere burnan on\n\u00d0anon to Culfrandene, \u00feanon for\u00f0 to \u00f0ere stowe, \u00fee man het Fiducscaga.\nSwa \u00f0wyres ofer \u00f0one feld on westhealfe on Hafucalras.\n\u00deanon on gerihta o\u00f0 hit cym\u00f0 to Tan \u00f0\u00e6re ea.\n\u00deanon on westhealfe to Melenbeorgeburnan: swa nor\u00f0 o\u00f0 Cyppanleage: \u00feanon to Melenburnan.\nSwa to \u00feam haran \u00f0orne, \u00feanon nor\u00f0 ofer \u00f0one feld westweard o\u00f0 hit cym\u00f0 to \u00f0an halgan \u00e6sce, & swa\n\u00deanon eft nor\u00f0 be ea o\u00f0 \u00f0a ealdan gemerdic, \u00f0anon to Pyttesforda: & swa on westhealf Lufesdune.\n\u00deanon nor\u00f0 on \u00f0a ealdan streat & swa \u00f0urh \u00f0one nor\u00f0 del on gerihta to \u00f0ere frymwylle, \u00fee man Wyllite\nSwa east on \u00f0one witan mor.\n\u00deanon to Lydegeard: \u00feanon nor\u00f0 o\u00f0 \u00f0a westhealfe \u00f0es mores \u00fee man het Wullucesmor: & swa on\n\u00deanon up ongen stream on nor\u00f0healf o\u00f0 \u00f0one langan \u00feorn.\n\u00deanon nor\u00f0 ofer \u00f0one feld, o\u00f0 \u00f0ne ealdan ambran weg: & swa on nor\u00f0healf Truscumbes, swa on \u00f0one\nSwa on easthealf on Ruganbeorg: of \u00f0ere stowe on nor\u00f0healf Escholtes on Horspa\u00f0esford.\n\u00deanon su\u00f0 on \u00f0one horegan ford, swa on Heanwille.\n\u00deanon on Gemotleage: swa on gerhita o\u00f0 Dundic, \u00feanon on Fiscwylle.\nSwa to Ellewylle: swa on middel del \u00fe\u00e6re dune \u00fee man Middelcnol nem\u00f0.\n\u00deanon on H\u00e6gelstalcumb & swa on Meccanfen: \u00feanon to \u00feere ri\u00f0e, \u00fe\u00e6t man Neglescumb clypa\u00f0.\nSwa east on midneweardne del \u00fe\u00e6re dune \u00fee man H\u00e6tbeorg nem\u00f0: & swa be ufeweardum Brigccumbe,\n\u00deanon on easthealf \u00fe\u00e6s mores \u00fee man Hafoc ford nem\u00f0: \u00feanon on H\u00e6gelstalcumb, & swa to \u00fe\u00e6re\n\u00deanon to Secgbroce, & swa on Tan \u00fea ea, & swa be eastreame o\u00f0 hyt cym\u00f0 eft on Beaddincgbeorh.\nTo Wi\u00feiclea; \u00e6r\u00e6st on Ucingford, of \u00fe\u00e6s cumbes heafde on \u00f0one smalan weg: \u00feurh \u00feone mor to\n\u00deanon to Brocenanbeorge: swa to Wuduforda: \u00feanon to Lullesbeorge.\nSwa for\u00f0 andlang hearpa\u00f0es to Megenstanes dene: swa to Wi\u00f0igleagate: \u00feanon to N\u00e6dranbeorge:\nTo Cearn\u00e6l; \u00e6r\u00e6st of s\u00e6 up on Hengsterhricg: \u00feonan nor\u00f0 on Gyrdweg: swa nor\u00f0 andlang hrigces on\n\u00deanon be cumbe innan Holanbroc.\n\u00deanon andlang streames innan Hlosmoc: adune on stream, on Syfoneceras: \u00feanon of streame eft\nEft su\u00f0 on Hlosmoc: \u00feanon adune on stream o\u00f0 \u00f0a suran a\u00feeldran.\n\u00deanon su\u00f0 on \u00fea nor\u00f0 rewe: \u00feanon eft on Cern on Gataford: \u00feanon su\u00f0 bufan lytlan graf.\nSwa su\u00f0 on Earneshlinc: Of Earneshlince eft ut on s\u00e6.\nTo Wecedforda; Erest on Keanulfesforda, up on stream on stangedelf: \u00feanon on dic: swa east on\n\u00deanon on hearpa\u00f0 o\u00f0 Brydanpytt: \u00feanon west andlang forda.\n\u00deanon su\u00f0 on stream: \u00feanon west on \u00feelbrygce.\n\u00d0anon nor\u00f0 on Heahbence eastewearde.\n\u00deanon on \u00f0one haran stan westanweardne: \u00feanon nor\u00f0 on \u00fe\u00e6t ealde hlidgeat.\nSwa nor\u00f0 on Hreodmere easteweardne.\nSwa ut on s\u00e6: of s\u00e6 on Wi\u00f0igcumbes heafod.\n\u00deanon su\u00f0 on Holandene: andlang denes eft on Ceanulfesford.",
